e_materia_medica","section":"male","label":"Male","startLine":23532,"endLine":23534,"text":"Violent erections. Chordee. [Kali brom.;\nCamph.]"},{"source":"04_boericke_materia_medica","section":"extremities","label":"Extremities","startLine":23535,"endLine":23542,"text":"Unsteady gait. Constant motion of\nwhole body. Tremulous. Intense redness in streaks,\nfollowing course of lymphatics. Twitching of limbs.\nRestless hands. Convulsive, uncontrollable movements\nof arms and legs. Limbs drag while walking.\n\n516 MYGALE LASIODORA — MYOSOTIS — MYRICA"},{"source":"04_boericke_materia_medica","section":"relationship","label":"Relationship","startLine":23543,"endLine":23545,"text":"Compare: Agar.; Tar ant.; Cupr.;\nZizia."},{"source":"04_boericke_materia_medica","section":"modalities","label":"Modalities","startLine":23546,"endLine":23548,"text":"Better, during sleep. Worse, in morn-\ning."},{"source":"12_boger_synoptic_key","section":"heart","label":"Heart","startLine":32041,"endLine":32053,"text":"BETTER:\nOpen air.\n\nDiscouraged. Dull headache, in the early morning. Yellow sclera. Very red eyelids. Combined\nliver and heart symptoms. Liver affections, with dull pain; with pain under either scapula; with\nurticaria; with jaundice. Jaundice of infants. Fulness and burning in gall-bladder. Foul, adhesive\nmucus in mouth, throat, or stool. Slow pulse.\n\nComplementary: Dig. Kali-bi.\nRelated: Chel."}],"corpusPassages":[]}